Package: lmsqreg
Version: 0.2.1
Title: LMS (Cole-Green 1992) Quantile Regression
Author: VJ Carey <stvjc@channing.harvard.edu>
Maintainer: VJ Carey <stvjc@channing.harvard.edu>
Description: Algorithms and graphics for nonlinear quantile regression using
    the LMS (Lambda-Mu-Sigma) method of Cole and Green (1992). Provides
    fitting, validation, and ggplot2-based visualization of reference centile
    curves.
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Imports:
    parody,
    ggplot2,
    patchwork,
    stats
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/vjcitn/lmsqreg
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Encoding: UTF-8
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
